---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
        <a href="/" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 text-sm font-semibold mb-8 inline-block">&larr; Back to Home</a>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Privacy Policy: Pixel-iT</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-8 font-mono">Effective Date: July 24, 2026</p>
        
        <section class="space-y-6 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">1. Introduction</h2>
            <p>This Privacy Policy (Πολιτική Απορρήτου) explains how GS Apps ("we", "us", or "our") handles information when you use the Pixel-iT mobile application.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">2. No Personal Data Collection (Καμία Συλλογή Προσωπικών Δεδομένων)</h2>
            <p>Pixel-iT operates entirely without user accounts. We do not ask for, collect, or store personal information such as your name, email address, or phone number. You can use the application completely anonymously.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">3. In-App Purchases & Financial Data (Οικονομικά Δεδομένα)</h2>
            <p>When you purchase "Pixels" to unlock features within the app, the transaction is processed securely and natively by the Google Play Store. We do not collect, process, or store your credit card information or billing details. To deliver your digital goods, we use an anonymous identifier via our payment gateway (RevenueCat) to verify the cryptographic receipt (κρυπτογραφική απόδειξη).</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">4. Device Data & Diagnostics (Διαγνωστικά Δεδομένα)</h2>
            <p>To ensure the app runs smoothly, the application framework (Expo) may collect standard, anonymous crash logs and diagnostic data (such as your device model and operating system version). This data is strictly used to identify software bugs and improve performance; it cannot be used to identify you personally.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">5. Third-Party Services (Υπηρεσίες Τρίτων)</h2>
            <p>Our app utilizes secure external infrastructure to function properly. These services have their own strict Privacy Policies:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                <li><strong>Google Play Services:</strong> For app delivery and payment processing.</li>
                <li><strong>RevenueCat:</strong> For anonymous purchase verification and receipt validation.</li>
                <li><strong>Expo:</strong> For application framework stability and error reporting.</li>
            </ul>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">6. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
            <p>We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect structural changes. You are advised to review this page periodically.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">7. Contact Us (Επικοινωνία)</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:schumigeos@gmail.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">schumigeos@gmail.com</a>.</p>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>